atelier preset for the prototype kit
====================================

This preset takes design values (warm neutral palette, colour roles in dark and
light, radius scale, type scale, inset sheen and soft drop shadows, motion,
component proportions and states) from the author's own portfolio design
system, contributed to the kit under the MIT licence. It contains no source
code, components, images, logos or personal content from the portfolio.

Structure (window size classes, 48 px touch targets, bottom sheet, navigation
bar, navigation rail, FAB, density levels) follows the published Material
Design 3 guidelines. No assets, icons, fonts or code from Material Design are
included.

Fonts are named, not bundled. Default families, all under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1:
  Geist and Geist Mono   Copyright (c) Vercel, https://vercel.com/font
  Manrope                Copyright (c) The Manrope Project Authors,
                         https://github.com/sharanda/manrope

Icons: Tabler Icons, MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2020-2024 Paweł Kuna,
https://tabler.io/icons

The component recipes render shadcn/ui and shadcn-vue components through the
same alias layer as the shadcn preset (CSS variable names only, MIT).

